OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry and
OL,6,Foften clear this evening and chilly
OL,7,Fwith a touch of frost in places. Cloud
OL,8,Fcould increase overnight with the odd
OL,9,Fshower, these mainly over the hills.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FMainly dry and bright with
OL,12,Foccasional sunny breaks. Cloudier at
OL,13,Ftimes with isolated showers. Winds
OL,14,Fwill be light from the northwest.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRather
OL,17,Fcloudy at times with bright spells and
OL,18,Fthe occasional showers. Winds will be
OL,19,Flight from the northeast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
